    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Tier 1 — Gnostic</strong></p><p><strong>“The lie is structural.”</strong></p><p>You can feel distortion now. Propaganda scrapes. Illusions itch. You may not yet know the truth, but you know when something is <em>false</em>.</p><p><strong>Tactical (Character Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>Gain a skill rank in <strong>Insight</strong></li><li>reroll the lowest die on checks against <strong>Illusion</strong> effects</li></ul><p><strong>Strategic (Faction Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>When your faction resists propaganda, misinformation, or psychological manipulation, gain <strong>+1 to the relevant Soft Power OP roll</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Cost:</strong> once you can feel falsehood structurally, ordinary social comfort gets harder. Expect friction when you refuse to participate in convenient lies.</p>",
